title: if they're already close neighbors, don't bother tying further
pid: aa5baecd-49a8-4a2c-a87f-0729a5e6a333
body: |2-
  If it's annoying having to file something in many places,
  but those places are already clsoe neighbors,
  filing it in one of them imples that a traversal habit
  that involves important neighbors is unlikely to lose it.
